API: genesis.options.morphs.Plane
Summary: Morph defined by a plane shape.
Signature: Plane(**data)
Constraints: Plane is a primitive with infinite size, visualization and collision cannot both be False, visualization parameter only used for RigidEntity, collision parameter only used for RigidEntity, fixed parameter only used for RigidEntity, batch_fixed_verts parameter only used for RigidEntityÿÿ